#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/1
msgid ""
"No one suspects me of being the one to let\n"
"Zadornov out of his cell.\n"
msgstr ""
"没人怀疑\n"
"是我放走了扎多尔诺夫。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/0
msgid ""
"Futbol, or \"soccer\" as it is known in the states,\n"
msgstr ""
"Futbol，美国人叫\"soccer\"，\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/1
msgid ""
"is extremely popular here.\n"
msgstr ""
"在这里极受欢迎。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/2
msgid ""
"It has not caught on yet in the US,\n"
msgstr ""
"美国还没流行起来，\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/3
msgid ""
"but it has legions of rabid fans all across Latin\n"
"America.\n"
msgstr ""
"但它在整个拉丁美洲\n"
"拥有大批狂热粉丝。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/4
msgid ""
"These fans can get so rowdy\n"
msgstr ""
"这些球迷闹起来，\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/5
msgid ""
"that it is commonly believed El Salvador and\n"
"Honduras went to war in 1969 over scuffles in a\n"
"soccer match.\n"
msgstr ""
"人们普遍认为萨尔瓦多和\n"
"洪都拉斯在1969年因一场\n"
"足球比赛中的冲突而开战。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/6
msgid ""
"In reality, tensions between the two countries were\n"
"already high.\n"
msgstr ""
"实际上，两国之间的紧张局势\n"
"早已高涨。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/7
msgid ""
"The match was merely one of the sparks that set\n"
"them off.\n"
msgstr ""
"那场比赛仅仅是\n"
"点燃导火索的火花之一。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/8
msgid ""
"But these people are so passionate about the\n"
"sport\n"
msgstr ""
"但这些人对这项运动\n"
"如此狂热\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/9
msgid ""
"that the story seems plausible.\n"
msgstr ""
"这说法听着也像真的。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/10
msgid ""
"Predictably, many of the soldiers here are fans.\n"
msgstr ""
"不出所料，这里很多兵都是球迷。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/11
msgid ""
"They have apparently divided themselves\n"
msgstr ""
"他们显然分成了\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/12
msgid ""
"into Costa Rican and Nicaraguan teams and\n"
"started playing each other.\n"
msgstr ""
"分成哥斯达黎加队和尼加拉瓜队，\n"
"开始互相比赛。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/13
msgid ""
"To play, you need a ball and two goals.\n"
msgstr ""
"踢球需要球和两个球门。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/14
msgid ""
"The R&D team built and set up simple goals on the\n"
"deck.\n"
msgstr ""
"研发团队在甲板上\n"
"搭建了简易球门。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/15
msgid ""
"I had absolutely no interest,\n"
msgstr ""
"我完全没兴趣，\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/16
msgid ""
"but Chico insisted that I come and watch.\n"
msgstr ""
"但奇科非要我来看。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/17
msgid ""
"It was not a proper match by any means -\n"
msgstr ""
"这根本算不上正规比赛——\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/18
msgid ""
"the pitch was not even regulation size -\n"
msgstr ""
"场地连标准尺寸都不到——\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/19
msgid ""
"but the players and spectators alike got pretty\n"
"excited.\n"
msgstr ""
"但球员和观众都\n"
"相当兴奋。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/20
msgid ""
"They banged empty cans and shouted cheers\n"
"through the handmade megaphones.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们敲着空罐子，用自制扩音器\n"
"呐喊助威。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/21
msgid ""
"It almost felt like Carnival.\n"
msgstr ""
"简直像狂欢节。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/22
msgid ""
"Huey, the referee, blew a whistle to start the\n"
"match.\n"
msgstr ""
"裁判 Huey 吹响哨子\n"
"开始比赛。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/23
msgid ""
"The soldiers' training has left them in excellent\n"
"physical shape.\n"
msgstr ""
"士兵们的训练让他们保持了\n"
"极佳的体能状态。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/24
msgid ""
"But they lacked the honed skills of professionals,\n"
msgstr ""
"但缺乏职业球员的精湛技术，\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/25
msgid ""
"and their play was quite rough.\n"
msgstr ""
"踢得相当粗野。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/26
msgid ""
"Midway through, one of the men collided with\n"
"another.\n"
msgstr ""
"比赛到一半，一人\n"
"与另一人相撞。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/27
msgid ""
"They started shouting at one another, but Huey\n"
"stepped in.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们开始互相叫嚷，但 Huey\n"
"介入调解。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/28
msgid ""
"\"I thought we had forsaken our countries, become\n"
"one with the earth,\" he said,\n"
msgstr ""
"“我以为我们已舍弃祖国，与大地\n"
"融为一体，”他说，\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/29
msgid ""
"quoting Snake.\n"
msgstr ""
"引用着SNAKE的话。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/30
msgid ""
"\"We're not competing for national pride here.\n"
msgstr ""
"“我们不是为国家荣誉而战。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/31
msgid ""
"And we are not fighting for the good of any one\n"
"country.\"\n"
msgstr ""
"我们不是为任何一个国家的\n"
"利益而战。”\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/32
msgid ""
"\"This is not a war. Soccer's a peaceful sport, am I\n"
"right?\"\n"
msgstr ""
"“这不是战争。足球是一项和平的运动，\n"
"我说得对吧？”\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/33
msgid ""
"The soldiers nodded.\n"
msgstr ""
"士兵们点头。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/34
msgid ""
"They know the pain of war, and they share Snake's\n"
"vision.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们懂战争之痛，也认同SNAKE的\n"
"理念。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/35
msgid ""
"Perhaps that is why this all resonates with them.\n"
msgstr ""
"也许正因如此，才引起他们共鸣。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/36
msgid ""
"Team Costa Rica was down a man,\n"
msgstr ""
"哥斯达黎加队少一人，\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/37
msgid ""
"and somehow I was picked to fill in.\n"
msgstr ""
"不知怎的选中我替补。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/38
msgid ""
"Costa Rica had the advantage up until that point -\n"
msgstr ""
"此前哥斯达黎加一直占优——\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/39
msgid ""
"I suppose Huey wanted to keep it balanced.\n"
msgstr ""
"休伊大概想保持平衡。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/40
msgid ""
"The soldiers agreed with Huey's call.\n"
msgstr ""
"士兵们都赞同休伊的决定。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/41
msgid ""
"Maybe the Costa Rican players felt an even match\n"
"up would be more fun, too.\n"
msgstr ""
"也许哥斯达黎加球员也觉得势均力敌\n"
"的比赛更好玩。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/42
msgid ""
"I could not be bothered to run at first,\n"
msgstr ""
"一开始我懒得跑，\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/43
msgid ""
"but chasing the ball out there in the hot sun, I was\n"
"soon drenched in sweat.\n"
msgstr ""
"但在烈日下追着球跑，我很快\n"
"就浑身是汗。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/44
msgid ""
"Before long I found myself actively seeking out the\n"
"ball,\n"
msgstr ""
"没过多久我就发现自己主动去\n"
"找球了，\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/45
msgid ""
"partially out of desperation.\n"
msgstr ""
"一半是出于无奈。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/46
msgid ""
"I picked up a loose ball deep on the opponents'\n"
"side of the field.\n"
msgstr ""
"我在对方半场深处捡到一个\n"
"散球。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/47
msgid ""
"Even though he's Nicaraguan, Chico cheered me\n"
"on, yelling \"Go for it! Shoot!\"\n"
msgstr ""
"奇科是尼加拉瓜人，却为我\n"
"加油喊“冲啊！射门！”\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/48
msgid ""
"I launched that ball as hard as I could,\n"
msgstr ""
"我用尽全力踢出那球，\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/49
msgid ""
"only to have it blocked by the keeper.\n"
msgstr ""
"却被守门员挡了下来。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/50
msgid ""
"Disappointment only increased my determination.\n"
msgstr ""
"失望反而让我更坚定。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/51
msgid ""
"In the end, I didn't score a single goal,\n"
msgstr ""
"最后我一个球都没进，\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/52
msgid ""
"and Costa Rica gave up its lead.\n"
msgstr ""
"哥斯达黎加丢了领先。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/53
msgid ""
"It was really close, though.\n"
msgstr ""
"不过比分很接近。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/54
msgid ""
"We congratulated each other on a good match\n"
msgstr ""
"我们互相祝贺这场好比赛\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/55
msgid ""
"and sprawled out in the shade on the deck,\n"
"exhausted.\n"
msgstr ""
"然后精疲力尽地瘫在甲板的\n"
"阴凉处。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/56
msgid ""
"The ocean breeze felt so nice on my sun-soaked\n"
"body.\n"
msgstr ""
"海风吹着我晒热的\n"
"身子，真舒服。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/57
msgid ""
"Nuke came over - it is one of his favorite spots -\n"
msgstr ""
"努克也来了，他最爱这儿\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/58
msgid ""
"and stretched out next to me.\n"
msgstr ""
"在我旁边伸展开来。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/59
msgid ""
"And together\n"
msgstr ""
"我们一起\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/60
msgid ""
"we watched fluffy white clouds drift lazily across\n"
"the clear blue sky.\n"
msgstr ""
"看着蓬松的白云懒洋洋地飘过\n"
"清澈的蓝天。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/0
msgid ""
"It was lovely out today,\n"
msgstr ""
"今天天气很好，\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/1
msgid ""
"so I decided to sun myself in a lounge chair up on\n"
"the deck\n"
msgstr ""
"所以我到甲板上\n"
"躺椅里晒太阳，\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/2
msgid ""
"when Strangelove came up to me.\n"
msgstr ""
"就在这时奇爱博士走了过来。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/3
msgid ""
"Despite the heat, she was in her usual long sleeves\n"
"and pants.\n"
msgstr ""
"天气很热，她还是老样子，\n"
"长袖长裤。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/4
msgid ""
"I waved at her.\n"
msgstr ""
"我向她挥手。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/5
msgid ""
"She looked away and mumbled, \"H-hello there.\n"
"Fancy meeting you here.\"\n"
msgstr ""
"她移开视线，嘀咕道：\n"
"「你、你好。真巧啊。」\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/6
msgid ""
"I asked if she needed anything,\n"
msgstr ""
"我问她有什么事，\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/7
msgid ""
"feeling her eyes creeping up and down my body,\n"
"like she was savoring it.\n"
msgstr ""
"感觉她的目光在我身上上下游走，\n"
"像在细细品味。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/8
msgid ""
"Finally she swallowed and said,\n"
msgstr ""
"最后她咽了口唾沫，说：\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/9
msgid ""
"\"You have such beautiful skin...\"\n"
msgstr ""
"「你的皮肤真美……」\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/10
msgid ""
"Bewildered, I shook my head and said, \"No, not at\n"
"all.\"\n"
msgstr ""
"我不知所措，摇摇头说：\n"
"「不，一点也谈不上。」\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/11
msgid ""
"I'd heard rumors that she was a... lesbian.\n"
msgstr ""
"我听说过她是个……同性恋。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/12
msgid ""
"But she couldn't be after me, could she?\n"
msgstr ""
"可她不至于看上我吧？\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/13
msgid ""
"She continued to stare and said,\n"
msgstr ""
"她继续盯着我，说：\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/14
msgid ""
"\"No, it is beautiful. But you must not let yourself\n"
"get so tanned.\"\n"
msgstr ""
"「不，真的很美。\n"
"可你不能晒这么黑。」\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/15
msgid ""
"And then she took my hand in hers.\n"
msgstr ""
"然后她握住了我的手。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/16
msgid ""
"\"What is wrong with a little sun?\" I asked, trying to\n"
"cut the conversation short.\n"
msgstr ""
"「晒一点太阳有什么关系？」\n"
"我想尽快结束话题。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/17
msgid ""
"But she shook her head violently.\n"
msgstr ""
"可她使劲摇头。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/18
msgid ""
"\"No! You mustn't! A young lady should take better\n"
"care of her skin!\"\n"
msgstr ""
"「不行！绝对不行！\n"
"年轻姑娘要好好爱护皮肤！」\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/19
msgid ""
"She was acting strangely, now, as if aroused.\n"
msgstr ""
"她举止变得奇怪，像是动了情。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/20
msgid ""
"She lectured me on the perils of tanning - how it\n"
"ages skin,\n"
msgstr ""
"她开始说教日晒的危害——\n"
"会让皮肤老化，\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/21
msgid ""
"causing wrinkles and spots, and in the worst cases\n"
"even skin cancer.\n"
msgstr ""
"长出皱纹和色斑，\n"
"严重的还会得皮肤癌。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/22
msgid ""
"I knew already that tanning could cause spots, but\n"
msgstr ""
"我知道日晒会长斑，不过\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/23
msgid ""
"I thought only pale-skinned Anglo-Saxons had to\n"
"deal with that.\n"
msgstr ""
"我以为只有白皮肤的\n"
"盎格鲁-撒克逊人才会。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/24
msgid ""
"Having a scientist tell me it causes aging, though -\n"
msgstr ""
"不过由科学家亲口说会衰老——\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/25
msgid ""
"that spooked me a little.\n"
msgstr ""
"这让我有点发毛。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/26
msgid ""
"If I am to keep playing the teenager,\n"
msgstr ""
"要继续扮演女学生，\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/27
msgid ""
"I will have to start paying more attention to my skin.\n"
msgstr ""
"我就得更注意皮肤保养了。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/28
msgid ""
"Sensing my anxiety, she took a small tube from her\n"
"pocket.\n"
msgstr ""
"她察觉到我的不安，\n"
"从口袋里掏出一支小管。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/29
msgid ""
"She said it was the sunscreen she always used.\n"
msgstr ""
"说那是她常用的防晒霜。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/30
msgid ""
"She told me to keep it. I didn't know what to say.\n"
msgstr ""
"她说送我了。我不知该说什么。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/31
msgid ""
"I was more than happy to take it, but exactly what\n"
"were her intentions?\n"
msgstr ""
"我当然乐意收下，\n"
"可她到底什么意图？\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/32
msgid ""
"Was she merely being nice?\n"
msgstr ""
"只是出于好意吗？\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/33
msgid ""
"Or is she really into me?\n"
msgstr ""
"还是真的对我有意思？\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/34
msgid ""
"Either way, there was no reason to refuse, I\n"
"suppose.\n"
msgstr ""
"不管怎样，\n"
"我想没有理由拒绝。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/35
msgid ""
"I have undergone training.\n"
msgstr ""
"我受过训练。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/36
msgid ""
"An out-of-shape woman doesn't pose any real\n"
"threat to me.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个缺乏锻炼的女人\n"
"对我构不成威胁。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/37
msgid ""
"Having power means not being afraid.\n"
msgstr ""
"拥有力量就无需畏惧。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/38
msgid ""
"It is the same on a global scale:\n"
msgstr ""
"国家层面也是一样：\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/39
msgid ""
"a country with nukes can dictate terms to a\n"
"country without them.\n"
msgstr ""
"有核国家可以对无核国家\n"
"发号施令。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/40
msgid ""
"I thanked her and took the tube.\n"
msgstr ""
"我道了谢，收下那支药膏。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/41
msgid ""
"Then she offered to put some on for me.\n"
msgstr ""
"接着她提出要帮我涂。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/42
msgid ""
"She squirted some lotion onto her fingers and\n"
"began rubbing it into my chest.\n"
msgstr ""
"她把乳液挤在手指上，\n"
"开始往我胸口涂。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/43
msgid ""
"It happened so suddenly,\n"
msgstr ""
"一切来得太突然，\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/44
msgid ""
"and I was so taken aback that I did not even think\n"
"to protest.\n"
msgstr ""
"我太过错愕，\n"
"根本没想到要反抗。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/45
msgid ""
"She caressed my stomach with her long, white\n"
"fingers,\n"
msgstr ""
"她用修长白皙的手指\n"
"抚过我的腹部，\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/46
msgid ""
"then slid them upwards between my bikini-clad\n"
"breasts.\n"
msgstr ""
"又向上滑进\n"
"我比基尼包裹的双乳之间。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/47
msgid ""
"\"Wha-? Wait...\" I sputtered as her moist eyes met\n"
"mine.\n"
msgstr ""
"「什、等等……」我结巴着，\n"
"对上她湿润的眼睛。\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/0
msgid ""
"Protecting one's health is an important part of any\n"
"agent's job,\n"
msgstr ""
"保持健康是\n"
"特工工作的重要一环，\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/1
msgid ""
"but despite my best efforts, I have caught a cold.\n"
msgstr ""
"可再怎么小心，我还是感冒了。\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/2
msgid ""
"Now that I think about it,\n"
msgstr ""
"现在想来，\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/3
msgid ""
"Mother Base's numbers are on the rise,\n"
msgstr ""
"母基地的人越来越多，\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/4
msgid ""
"with soldiers coming from all different places and\n"
"backgrounds.\n"
msgstr ""
"士兵们来自\n"
"各地不同的背景。\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/5
msgid ""
"It is no wonder, then, that sooner or later someone\n"
"would bring in a virus.\n"
msgstr ""
"迟早有人把病毒带进来，\n"
"也不足为奇。\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/6
msgid ""
"That said, what I have got is just a common cold.\n"
msgstr ""
"不过我得的只是普通感冒。\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/7
msgid ""
"The medical team said I'd need a few days' rest,\n"
msgstr ""
"医疗组说要休息几天，\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/8
msgid ""
"so I've been restricted to my room and put on bed\n"
"rest.\n"
msgstr ""
"于是我被关在房间里\n"
"卧床静养。\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/9
msgid ""
"I thought I'd gotten used to not having anyone\n"
"around to relate to...\n"
msgstr ""
"我以为自己已经习惯了\n"
"身边无人可以倾诉……\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/10
msgid ""
"But at times like these, being alone is just...\n"
"miserable.\n"
msgstr ""
"可这种时候，孤独\n"
"实在……难熬。\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/11
msgid ""
"All I could do is lay there and stroke Nuke's back,\n"
msgstr ""
"我只能躺着抚摸Nuke的背，\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/12
msgid ""
"trying to take my mind off how bad I felt.\n"
msgstr ""
"好让自己不去想有多难受。\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/13
msgid ""
"Nuke just sat there, not making a sound.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nuke只是静静地坐着，一声不响。\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/14
msgid ""
"But I did have visitors:\n"
msgstr ""
"不过也有人来看我：\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/15
msgid ""
"Amanda and Chico, Huey, Cecile, Miller, and a few\n"
"of the soldiers I've become relatively close to.\n"
msgstr ""
"阿曼达和奇科、休伊、塞西尔、米勒，\n"
"还有几个比较熟的士兵。\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/16
msgid ""
"Amanda made me a soup with herbs she said were\n"
"good for a cold.\n"
msgstr ""
"阿曼达用对感冒有益的草药\n"
"给我煮了汤。\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/17
msgid ""
"Miller told me to take it easy. \"I will sing you a\n"
"lullaby,\"\n"
msgstr ""
"米勒让我放轻松。\n"
"「我给你唱首摇篮曲，」\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/18
msgid ""
"he said, then broke out a guitar and sang some\n"
"incomprehensible song in Japanese.\n"
msgstr ""
"他说着掏出吉他，\n"
"唱了首听不懂的日语歌。\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/19
msgid ""
"I did not need to understand the lyrics to know\n"
"he's an awful singer.\n"
msgstr ""
"不用听懂歌词，\n"
"我也知道他唱得极差。\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/20
msgid ""
"Then he said, \"You know what is good for a cold?\n"
"Suppositories! Here, I'll show you...\"\n"
msgstr ""
"然后他说：「你知道感冒最有效的是什么吗？\n"
"栓剂！来，我示范给你看……」\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/21
msgid ""
"He began to take off his pants, so I threw my\n"
"tissue box at him to make him go away.\n"
msgstr ""
"他开始脱裤子，\n"
"我抓起纸巾盒砸他，把他赶走。\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/22
msgid ""
"Then Strangelove showed up, saying she had some\n"
"miracle Indian cure.\n"
msgstr ""
"接着奇爱博士来了，\n"
"说有印度的神奇疗法。\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/23
msgid ""
"\"It has got eucalyptus extract,\" she said. \"It works\n"
"best if you rub it into your chest.\"\n"
msgstr ""
"「里面含有桉树精华，」她说。\n"
"「涂在胸口效果最好。」\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/24
msgid ""
"And then she tried to take off my nightshirt.\n"
msgstr ""
"然后她就要脱我的睡衣。\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/25
msgid ""
"I whacked her with my pillow. And that got rid of\n"
"her.\n"
msgstr ""
"我拿枕头砸她，\n"
"总算把她赶走了。\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/26
msgid ""
"Chico brought me a little flower in a cup.\n"
msgstr ""
"奇科用杯子给我带了朵小花。\n"

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/0
msgid ""
"Every month,\n"
msgstr ""
"每个月，\n"

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/1
msgid ""
"Mother Base throws a party for all the soldiers\n"
"whose birthdays fall in that month.\n"
msgstr ""
"母基地都会为当月过生日的士兵\n"
"办一场聚会。\n"

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/2
msgid ""
"There's something strange about a military\n"
"organization having parties.\n"
msgstr ""
"军队这种组织办聚会，\n"
"总觉得有些奇怪。\n"

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/3
msgid ""
"Really, though, it is just an excuse to drink and\n"
"make noise.\n"
msgstr ""
"不过说到底，\n"
"只是个喝酒喧闹的借口。\n"

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/4
msgid ""
"It is not easy to get alcohol on a fortress in the\n"
"middle of the ocean.\n"
msgstr ""
"在大海中央的堡垒里，\n"
"酒可不容易弄到。\n"

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/5
msgid ""
"Most days they are training from dawn till dusk.\n"
msgstr ""
"平日他们从早训练到晚。\n"

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/6
msgid ""
"They do not have time for things like drinking.\n"
msgstr ""
"根本没时间喝酒。\n"

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/7
msgid ""
"That is why Snake and Miller came up with the\n"
"idea - to give everyone a chance to let loose.\n"
msgstr ""
"所以Snake和米勒才出了这主意——\n"
"让大家有机会放松一下。\n"

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/8
msgid ""
"Obviously, a bunch of boors like that are not going\n"
"to bother with blowing out candles on a cake.\n"
msgstr ""
"显然，这帮粗人不会去\n"
"吹蛋糕上的蜡烛。\n"

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/9
msgid ""
"Rather, they sit there in a cloud of cigarette\n"
"smoke,\n"
msgstr ""
"他们只是坐在\n"
"烟雾缭绕里，\n"

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/10
msgid ""
"drink beer, eat meat, tell tasteless jokes and swap\n"
"crude insults about one another's hometowns.\n"
msgstr ""
"喝啤酒、吃肉、讲荤段子，\n"
"互相拿家乡开粗俗的玩笑。\n"

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/11
msgid ""
"But it hardly ever breaks out into something\n"
"serious.\n"
msgstr ""
"但很少\n"
"真的闹起来。\n"

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/12
msgid ""
"They talk up a storm, but they're just having fun.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们吵得热闹，其实只是开心。\n"

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/13
msgid ""
"It is funny. You've got members of FSLN rubbing\n"
"shoulders with the UCLAs.\n"
msgstr ""
"真有意思。桑解阵的人\n"
"竟和UCLA的人并肩而坐。\n"

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/14
msgid ""
"People who once would have considered the other\n"
"mortal enemies.\n"
msgstr ""
"换作从前，\n"
"他们可是死敌。\n"

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/15
msgid ""
"I wonder if that is what makes Big Boss so popular.\n"
msgstr ""
"也许正因如此Big Boss才如此受拥戴。\n"

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/16
msgid ""
"In leaving their countries behind, they leave their\n"
"hatred for other countries, too.\n"
msgstr ""
"离开祖国的同时，\n"
"他们也放下了对他国的仇恨。\n"

#: codec/1/273/0x111960/0
msgid ""
"D'you know Miller, Snake's right hand man?\n"
msgstr ""
"你认识Snake的左右手米勒吗？\n"

#: codec/1/273/0x111960/1
msgid ""
"Apparently he's got at least one serious weakness.\n"
msgstr ""
"据说他有个致命的弱点。\n"

#: codec/1/273/0x111960/2
msgid ""
"He is an insatiable womanizer.\n"
msgstr ""
"他是个不知餍足的花花公子。\n"

#: codec/1/273/0x111960/3
msgid ""
"He does not bother me, most likely because he\n"
"considers teenagers off limits.\n"
msgstr ""
"他不骚扰我，大概是因为\n"
"他把少女排除在外。\n"

#: codec/1/273/0x111960/4
msgid ""
"But he has hit on every single one of the few\n"
"female solders here at Mother Base.\n"
msgstr ""
"可母基地里为数不多的女兵，\n"
"他一个都不放过。\n"

#: codec/1/273/0x111960/5
msgid ""
"They ought to be telling him where to stick it, but\n"
"end up falling for it so easily.\n"
msgstr ""
"她们本该让他滚蛋，\n"
"却一个个轻易上钩。\n"

#: codec/1/273/0x111960/6
msgid ""
"I think some of it stems from the fact that he is\n"
"actually not that bad looking.\n"
msgstr ""
"我想部分原因是\n"
"他其实长得不差。\n"

#: codec/1/273/0x111960/7
msgid ""
"Anyway, today that nasty habit got him in trouble.\n"
msgstr ""
"总之，今天这恶习让他惹祸了。\n"

#: codec/1/273/0x111960/8
msgid ""
"He and Snake got into one of their rare fights, and\n"
"I was there to see it.\n"
msgstr ""
"他和Snake难得地打了一架，\n"
"我正好在场。\n"

#: codec/1/273/0x111960/9
msgid ""
"They burst out of the showers, completely naked,\n"
"trading punches.\n"
msgstr ""
"两人一丝不挂地冲出浴室，\n"
"拳脚相加。\n"

#: codec/1/273/0x111960/10
msgid ""
"I am no child - the sight of a naked man doesn't\n"
"make me blush. But this was something else.\n"
msgstr ""
"我不是小孩子——看到裸男\n"
"不会脸红。可这次不一样。\n"

#: codec/1/273/0x111960/11
msgid ""
"\"Maybe this'll teach you!\" Snake yelled as he\n"
"slammed his fists into Miller's chest.\n"
msgstr ""
"「这下长记性了吧！」Snake大喊着，\n"
"双拳砸向米勒的胸口。\n"

#: codec/1/273/0x111960/12
msgid ""
"I heard later that apparently he'd been two-timing\n"
"someone...\n"
msgstr ""
"后来听说，\n"
"他好像脚踏两条船……\n"

#: codec/1/273/0x111960/13
msgid ""
"and that same someone had gone to Snake with\n"
"her troubles.\n"
msgstr ""
"而那个受害者\n"
"跑去向Snake诉苦。\n"

#: codec/1/273/0x111960/14
msgid ""
"As I see it, it is her own fault for letting herself be\n"
"deceived like that.\n"
msgstr ""
"在我看来，\n"
"被人骗成那样是她自己的错。\n"

#: codec/1/273/0x111960/15
msgid ""
"If she's too dumb to see though Miller's lies, then\n"
"she got what she deserved.\n"
msgstr ""
"蠢到看不穿米勒的谎言，\n"
"那是她自作自受。\n"

#: codec/1/273/0x111960/16
msgid ""
"But this was not the first time it had happened, or\n"
"the second, and Snake read Miller the riot act.\n"
msgstr ""
"可这不是第一次，也不是第二次，\n"
"Snake把米勒狠狠训了一顿。\n"

#: codec/1/273/0x111960/17
msgid ""
"Miller argued back, and what began as a shouting\n"
"match turned into a fistfight.\n"
msgstr ""
"米勒顶了几句，\n"
"争吵就变成了互殴。\n"

#: codec/1/273/0x111960/18
msgid ""
"\"You son of a bitch!\" Miller yelled as he swung.\n"
msgstr ""
"「你这混蛋！」米勒边骂边挥拳。\n"

#: codec/1/273/0x111960/19
msgid ""
"\"Not bad,\" said Snake, smiling. \"But not good\n"
"enough!\" And then he was back on the offensive.\n"
msgstr ""
"「不错，」Snake笑着说，\n"
"「但还不够！」随即又攻了上去。\n"

#: codec/1/274/0x112b00/0
msgid ""
"All of Mother Base is preparing for a festival.\n"
msgstr ""
"整个母基地都在筹备庆典。\n"

#: codec/1/274/0x112b00/1
msgid ""
"Since Snake and his soldiers spend so much time\n"
"fighting,\n"
msgstr ""
"因为Snake和士兵们\n"
"常年征战，\n"

#: codec/1/274/0x112b00/2
msgid ""
"they're setting aside one day a year for peace and\n"
"relaxation.\n"
msgstr ""
"所以每年留出一天\n"
"用来和平与休憩。\n"

#: codec/1/274/0x112b00/3
msgid ""
"I do not know all the details, but apparently that is\n"
"what Snake and Miller decided.\n"
msgstr ""
"细节我不清楚，\n"
"听说是Snake和米勒定的。\n"

#: codec/1/274/0x112b00/4
msgid ""
"The soldiers love the idea, of course.\n"
msgstr ""
"士兵们当然举双手赞成。\n"

#: codec/1/274/0x112b00/5
msgid ""
"There is so little fun to be had here that\n"
"everybody looks forward to events like these.\n"
msgstr ""
"这里实在没什么乐子，\n"
"大家都盼着这种活动。\n"

#: codec/1/274/0x112b00/6
msgid ""
"That is all well and good, but somehow I got roped\n"
"into getting on stage...\n"
msgstr ""
"这倒没什么，\n"
"可我不知怎么被拉上了台……\n"

#: codec/1/274/0x112b00/7
msgid ""
"\"C'mon, we even both have 'peace' in our names,\"\n"
"said Miller.\n"
msgstr ""
"「来嘛，咱俩名字里都有『和平』，」\n"
"米勒说。\n"

#: codec/1/274/0x112b00/8
msgid ""
"\"And Zadornov - that old Russkie's name has\n"
"something to do with peace, too, right?\n"
msgstr ""
"「还有扎多尔诺夫——那俄国佬的名字\n"
"也跟和平有关，对吧？\n"

#: codec/1/274/0x112b00/9
msgid ""
"\"Hey, as long as we're having a day of peace, we\n"
"ought to get an act together - The Three Peace\n"
"Band!\"\n"
msgstr ""
"「既然要办和平日，\n"
"干脆组个乐队——\n"
"和平三人组！」\n"

#: codec/1/274/0x112b00/10
msgid ""
"I thought he was joking.\n"
msgstr ""
"我以为他在开玩笑。\n"

#: codec/1/274/0x112b00/11
msgid ""
"He then proceeded to share his idea without\n"
"bothering to check with me, and now I am slated\n"
"to sing.\n"
msgstr ""
"他不问我的意见就四处宣扬，\n"
"现在我已被安排\n"
"上台演唱。\n"

#: codec/1/274/0x112b00/12
msgid ""
"Apparently, he had heard me on deck one day and\n"
"since then he's wanted to form a band.\n"
msgstr ""
"听说他某天在甲板上听见我唱歌，\n"
"从此就想组乐队。\n"

#: codec/1/274/0x112b00/13
msgid ""
"Everybody's looking forward to it, so there is no\n"
"way for me to back out now.\n"
msgstr ""
"大家都很期待，\n"
"我现在没法推了。\n"

#: codec/1/274/0x112b00/14
msgid ""
"I have never done anything like this, but it does\n"
"feel kind of nice to know that people are looking\n"
"forward to it.\n"
msgstr ""
"我从没做过这种事，\n"
"但知道有人期待，\n"
"心里也有点高兴。\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/0
msgid ""
"My cover is blown!\n"
msgstr ""
"我的身份暴露了！\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/1
msgid ""
"They know nothing of Cipher or my true objective,\n"
"but they know I am a spy.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们还不知道Cipher和我的真正目的，\n"
"但已经知道我是间谍。\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/2
msgid ""
"There's no more time left. I must act now.\n"
msgstr ""
"没有时间了。我必须现在行动。\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/3
msgid ""
"I must complete my mission...\n"
msgstr ""
"我必须完成任务……\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/4
msgid ""
"How did it come to this... All I wanted was three\n"
"more days, just three...\n"
msgstr ""
"怎么会走到这一步……\n"
"我只想要三天，只要三天……\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/5
msgid ""
"Miller's already finished writing the song. It's called\n"
"\"Love Deterrent (KOI NO YOKUSHI-RYOKU)\"\n"
msgstr ""
"米勒已经把歌写好了。\n"
"曲名是《恋爱的威慑力》。\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/6
msgid ""
"- it is about a girl who can't express her true\n"
"feelings.\n"
msgstr ""
"——唱的是个无法表达\n"
"真心意的女孩。\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/7
msgid ""
"I have been practicing.\n"
msgstr ""
"我一直在练习。\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/8
msgid ""
"I am no pro, but I was pretty sure I would do a\n"
"decent job.\n"
msgstr ""
"我算不上专业，\n"
"但本来有把握唱得还行。\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/9
msgid ""
"And now this...\n"
msgstr ""
"可现在……\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/10
msgid ""
"Cipher found out that ZEKE was complete.\n"
msgstr ""
"Cipher得知ZEKE已经完工。\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/11
msgid ""
"He must have someone inside Mother Base besides\n"
"me.\n"
msgstr ""
"除了我，母基地里\n"
"一定还有他的人。\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/12
msgid ""
"Spinning his tightly wound web of control, leaving\n"
"no room for individual will - typical.\n"
msgstr ""
"他精心编织控制之网，\n"
"不留半点个人意志——老样子。\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/13
msgid ""
"When they found out ZEKE was complete, I was\n"
"ordered to execute the operation immediately.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们得知ZEKE完工后，\n"
"就命令我立即执行作战。\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/14
msgid ""
"If I was going to enjoy just one day of peace, I had\n"
"to ensure the plan could not move forward.\n"
msgstr ""
"要想享受哪怕一天的和平，\n"
"我就得让计划无法推进。\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/15
msgid ""
"...I tried to sabotage ZEKE.\n"
msgstr ""
"……我试图破坏ZEKE。\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/16
msgid ""
"I thought by damaging the drive system, they\n"
"would have no choice but to delay their plans...\n"
msgstr ""
"我以为破坏驱动系统，\n"
"他们就只能推迟计划……\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/17
msgid ""
"I waited until midnight and then snuck into the\n"
"hangar.\n"
msgstr ""
"我等到午夜，\n"
"悄悄溜进机库。\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/18
msgid ""
"There would be trouble if it looked like sabotage.\n"
msgstr ""
"要是被看出是破坏就麻烦了。\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/19
msgid ""
"I selected one of the drive system's load-bearing\n"
"parts and carefully worked to warp its shape.\n"
msgstr ""
"我挑了驱动系统的一处承重部件，\n"
"小心地让它变形。\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/20
msgid ""
"The legs' drive system requires a high degree of\n"
"precision to operate.\n"
msgstr ""
"腿部的驱动系统\n"
"需要极高精度的配合。\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/21
msgid ""
"Even the smallest deviation would have done it.\n"
msgstr ""
"哪怕极其微小的偏差也足够了。\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/22
msgid ""
"Then Chico walked in.\n"
msgstr ""
"这时奇科走了进来。\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/23
msgid ""
"Maybe it was one of those nights where he could\n"
"not sleep.\n"
msgstr ""
"也许是那种\n"
"睡不着觉的夜晚。\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/24
msgid ""
"In any case, he saw me, panicked, and took off\n"
"running.\n"
msgstr ""
"总之他看到我，慌了神，\n"
"转身就跑。\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/25
msgid ""
"It would have been easy to kill him. But I could not!\n"
msgstr ""
"杀他易如反掌。可我下不了手！\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/26
msgid ""
"I know he... likes me.\n"
msgstr ""
"我知道他……喜欢我。\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/27
msgid ""
"It is not as if I would ever have an interest in a\n"
"child like him...\n"
msgstr ""
"我当然不可能\n"
"对他这种小孩有兴趣……\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/28
msgid ""
"But I could not pull the trigger. Not at him. Not in\n"
"the back.\n"
msgstr ""
"可我扣不下扳机。不能对他，\n"
"更不能在背后。\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/29
msgid ""
"Will he tell them?\n"
msgstr ""
"他会说出去吗？\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/30
msgid ""
"Or is there a chance he will keep it secret?\n"
"Protect me...\n"
msgstr ""
"还是有可能替我保密？\n"
"保护我……\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/31
msgid ""
"...No.\n"
msgstr ""
"……不会。\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/32
msgid ""
"He knows now... Knows I am not who he thought I\n"
"was...\n"
msgstr ""
"他已经知道了……\n"
"知道我不是他以为的那个人……\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/33
msgid ""
"He ran without even questioning what I was doing.\n"
"There is no chance he does not know.\n"
msgstr ""
"他连问都没问就跑了，\n"
"不可能不知道。\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/34
msgid ""
"And soon, all I have built here will end.\n"
msgstr ""
"很快，我在这里建立的一切都将终结。\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/35
msgid ""
"And if Cipher has another agent among them...\n"
msgstr ""
"如果Cipher在他们之中还安插了人……\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/36
msgid ""
"If he finds out I tried to sabotage ZEKE...\n"
msgstr ""
"要是他发现我试图破坏ZEKE……\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/37
msgid ""
"This place will no longer be my \"heaven.\"\n"
msgstr ""
"这里就不再是我的「天堂」了。\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/38
msgid ""
"...Then it is settled.\n"
msgstr ""
"……那就这么定了。\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/39
msgid ""
"I make my move now.\n"
msgstr ""
"我现在就动手。\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/40
msgid ""
"Chico walked in before my sabotage was complete,\n"
"so ZEKE should still be operational.\n"
msgstr ""
"奇科进来时我的破坏还没完成，\n"
"所以ZEKE应该还能运转。\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/41
msgid ""
"It might not run at full speed or power, but I do\n"
"not have time to fix that.\n"
msgstr ""
"速度或功率也许不足，\n"
"但我没时间补救了。\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/42
msgid ""
"Without ZEKE, I do not have a chance in hell of\n"
"winning.\n"
msgstr ""
"没有ZEKE，\n"
"我根本没有胜算。\n"

#: codec/1/275/0x1135b0/43
msgid ""
"I must act fast before Chico sounds the alarm...\n"
msgstr ""
"得赶在奇科报信前动手……\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/0
msgid ""
"She told me everything.\n"
msgstr ""
"她把一切都告诉了我。\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/1
msgid ""
"Why did she open her heart to me like that?\n"
msgstr ""
"她为什么对我敞开心扉？\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/2
msgid ""
"At the time, I couldn't understand it.\n"
msgstr ""
"当时我无法理解。\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/3
msgid ""
"But now I think I do.\n"
msgstr ""
"现在我想我明白了。\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/5
msgid ""
"she wanted you to know the truth\n"
msgstr ""
"她想让你知道真相\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/6
msgid ""
"She chose me to tell you.\n"
msgstr ""
"她选了我来告诉你。\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/7
msgid ""
"That's why she saved my life.\n"
msgstr ""
"所以她才救了我的命。\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/8
msgid ""
"I've lied to you so many times. But not this time.\n"
msgstr ""
"我骗过你很多次。但这次不会。\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/9
msgid ""
"My orders from the government were to obtain the\n"
"Legacy...\n"
msgstr ""
"政府给我的命令\n"
"是夺取遗产……\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/10
msgid ""
"...and to eliminate everyone who knew the truth\n"
"about what happened.\n"
msgstr ""
"……并除掉所有\n"
"知道事情真相的人。\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/11
msgid ""
"In other words, I'm supposed to kill you.\n"
msgstr ""
"换句话说，我该杀了你。\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/12
msgid ""
"But I can't do it.\n"
msgstr ""
"可我做不到。\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/13
msgid ""
"Not because we loved each other.\n"
msgstr ""
"不是因为我们相爱过。\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/14
msgid ""
"And not because you saved my life.\n"
msgstr ""
"也不是因为你救过我。\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/15
msgid ""
"But because I made a promise to The Boss...\n"
msgstr ""
"而是因为我对The Boss许下过承诺……\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/16
msgid ""
"And I intend to keep it.\n"
msgstr ""
"我打算信守它。\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/17
msgid ""
"I just wanted you to know.\n"
msgstr ""
"我只是想让你知道。\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/18
msgid ""
"And...\n"
msgstr ""
"还有……\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/19
msgid ""
"you have to live.\n"
msgstr ""
"你必须活下去。\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/20
msgid ""
"Snake, listen to me.\n"
msgstr ""
"Snake，听我说。\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/21
msgid ""
"She didn't betray the United States.\n"
msgstr ""
"她没有背叛美国。\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/22
msgid ""
"No, far from it. She was a hero who died for her\n"
"country.\n"
msgstr ""
"恰恰相反。\n"
"她是为国捐躯的英雄。\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/23
msgid ""
"She carried out her mission knowing full well what\n"
"was going to happen.\n"
msgstr ""
"她明知结局，\n"
"依然执行了任务。\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/24
msgid ""
"Self-sacrifice... because that was her duty.\n"
msgstr ""
"自我牺牲……因为那是她的职责。\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/25
msgid ""
"The Boss' defection was a ruse set up by the U.S.\n"
"government.\n"
msgstr ""
"The Boss的叛逃\n"
"是美国政府设下的骗局。\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/26
msgid ""
"It was all a big drama staged by Washington\n"
msgstr ""
"整件事都是华盛顿导演的一出大戏，\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/27
msgid ""
"so they could get their hands on the Philosophers'\n"
"Legacy.\n"
msgstr ""
"为的是拿到\n"
"哲学家们的遗产。\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/28
msgid ""
"And The Boss was the star of the show.\n"
msgstr ""
"而The Boss是这出戏的主角。\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/29
msgid ""
"They planned it so that they could get the Legacy\n"
"that Colonel Volgin inherited...\n"
msgstr ""
"他们如此谋划，是为了夺取\n"
"沃尔金上校继承的遗产……\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/30
msgid ""
"...and destroy the Shagohod at the same time.\n"
msgstr ""
"……同时摧毁Shagohod。\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/31
msgid ""
"Only a legendary hero like The Boss could have\n"
"earned Volgin's trust.\n"
msgstr ""
"只有The Boss这样的传奇英雄，\n"
"才能取得沃尔金的信任。\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/32
msgid ""
"Finding out where the Philosophers' Legacy was\n"
"hidden was to be her greatest mission.\n"
msgstr ""
"查出遗产的藏匿之处，\n"
"是她最重要的使命。\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/33
msgid ""
"Everything was going according to plan...\n"
msgstr ""
"一切都按计划进行……\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/34
msgid ""
"But then something happened that no one could\n"
"have predicted.\n"
msgstr ""
"可接着发生了\n"
"谁也没料到的事。\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/35
msgid ""
"Colonel Volgin fired an American-made nuclear\n"
"warhead at Sokolov's research facility.\n"
msgstr ""
"沃尔金上校向索科洛夫的研究所\n"
"发射了美国制造的核弹头。\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/36
msgid ""
"Khrushchev demanded that the U.S. government\n"
"provide proof that it wasn't involved...\n"
msgstr ""
"赫鲁晓夫要求美国政府\n"
"拿出与此事无关的证明……\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/37
msgid ""
"They couldn't just abort the operation to steal the\n"
"Legacy.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们又不能\n"
"就此中止夺取遗产的行动。\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/38
msgid ""
"So the operation itself was greatly expanded and\n"
"revised.\n"
msgstr ""
"于是行动规模\n"
"被大幅扩大和修改。\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/39
msgid ""
"The authorities in Washington knew that in order\n"
"to prove its innocence,\n"
msgstr ""
"华盛顿当局清楚，\n"
"要想证明自己的清白，\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/40
msgid ""
"it had to get rid of The Boss...\n"
msgstr ""
"就必须除掉The Boss……\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/41
msgid ""
"...and that one of their own would have to do the\n"
"job.\n"
msgstr ""
"……而且必须由\n"
"他们自己的人动手。\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/42
msgid ""
"The public couldn't be allowed to find out about it...\n"
"not ever.\n"
msgstr ""
"绝不能让公众知道真相……\n"
"永远不能。\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/43
msgid ""
"This, they concluded, would be the best way to\n"
"keep the whole thing under wraps.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们认定，\n"
"这是把整件事捂住的最好办法。\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/44
msgid ""
"The Boss wouldn't be allowed to come back home\n"
"alive.\n"
msgstr ""
"上层不许The Boss\n"
"活着回国。\n"

#: codec/1/276/0x1145f0/45
msgid ""
"And she wouldn't be allowed to kill herself.\n"
msgstr ""
"也不许她自尽。\n"

#: codec/1/277/0x115da0/0
msgid ""
"Hello, Snake. It's been a while, hasn't it?\n"
msgstr ""
"你好啊Snake，好久不见。\n"

#: codec/1/277/0x115da0/1
msgid ""
"...I hear you've been causing quite the ruckus in\n"
"Nicaragua.\n"
msgstr ""
"……听说你在尼加拉瓜\n"
"闹得挺大。\n"

#: codec/1/277/0x115da0/2
msgid ""
"Nothing much to report from my end.\n"
msgstr ""
"我这边没什么可报的。\n"

#: codec/1/277/0x115da0/3
msgid ""
"The Legacy's being \"put to good use\" - or so they\n"
"tell me...\n"
msgstr ""
"遗产正被「善加利用」——\n"
"他们是这样告诉我的……\n"

#: codec/1/277/0x115da0/4
msgid ""
"But enough with the small talk... there's something I\n"
"need to tell you.\n"
msgstr ""
"闲话到此为止……\n"
"有件事我必须告诉你。\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/0
msgid ""
"The Philosophers were a secret society of\n"
"powerbrokers formed in a pact\n"
msgstr ""
"哲学家们是一个由权贵组成的秘密结社，\n"
"源自20世纪初的一纸盟约\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/1
msgid ""
"between the U.S., Russia, and China in the early\n"
"20th century.\n"
msgstr ""
"由美国、俄国和中国\n"
"在20世纪初订立。\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/2
msgid ""
"Of course, by that time the American and Soviet\n"
"branches had already parted ways.\n"
msgstr ""
"当然，那时美国和苏联的分支\n"
"早已分道扬镳。\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/3
msgid ""
"But there were those among the remaining Russian\n"
"Philosophers\n"
msgstr ""
"但留在俄国的哲学家之中，\n"
"仍有人\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/4
msgid ""
"not entirely happy with the one-party Communist\n"
"state.\n"
msgstr ""
"对一党专政的共产主义体制\n"
"并不满意。\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/5
msgid ""
"The Boss reached out to them.\n"
msgstr ""
"The Boss主动接触了他们。\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/6
msgid ""
"She arranged clandestine meetings in Berlin, hoping\n"
"to find a way into OKB-1,\n"
msgstr ""
"她在柏林安排秘密会面，\n"
"希望打进OKB-1，\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/7
msgid ""
"the Soviets' premier design bureau.\n"
msgstr ""
"苏联首屈一指的设计局。\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/8
msgid ""
"She worked tirelessly to win their sympathy - in\n"
"some instances using huge sums of cash,\n"
msgstr ""
"她不遗余力地博取他们的同情——\n"
"有时用巨额现金，\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/9
msgid ""
"in others by helping them over the Berlin Wall.\n"
msgstr ""
"有时帮他们翻越柏林墙。\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/10
msgid ""
"It was a dangerous game to be playing.\n"
msgstr ""
"这是一场危险的游戏。\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/11
msgid ""
"The Philosophers had everything on her. And not\n"
"just information, either.\n"
msgstr ""
"哲学家们掌握着她的一切。\n"
"而且不只是情报。\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/12
msgid ""
"She'd given birth to a child on the battlefield, only\n"
"to have them immediately snatch it away.\n"
msgstr ""
"她曾在战场上生下孩子，\n"
"却立刻被他们夺走。\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/13
msgid ""
"I know she told you that story.\n"
msgstr ""
"我知道她跟你说过这件事。\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/14
msgid ""
"If that child was in the hands of the Soviet\n"
"Philosophers,\n"
msgstr ""
"如果那个孩子\n"
"落在苏联哲学家手里，\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/15
msgid ""
"she'd be putting more than just herself in danger.\n"
msgstr ""
"她危及的就不止自己了。\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/16
msgid ""
"But she did what she had to do.\n"
msgstr ""
"但她做了该做的事。\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/17
msgid ""
"At the time, the Soviet Union was believed to have\n"
"an arsenal of missiles\n"
msgstr ""
"当时人们相信苏联\n"
"拥有大量导弹，\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/18
msgid ""
"far greater than that of the United States.\n"
msgstr ""
"远多于美国。\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/19
msgid ""
"If that proved to be the case, Moscow would be\n"
"free from the yoke of nuclear deterrence...\n"
msgstr ""
"若真是这样，莫斯科就能\n"
"摆脱核威慑的枷锁……\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/20
msgid ""
"Raising the possibility that the Soviets might\n"
"actually launch nukes\n"
msgstr ""
"这样一来，苏联\n"
"就有可能真的动用核武器\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/21
msgid ""
"- if they felt it necessary.\n"
msgstr ""
"——只要他们认为有必要。\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/22
msgid ""
"As you know, the so-called missile gap turned out\n"
"to be a Soviet bluff.\n"
msgstr ""
"如你所知，所谓导弹差距\n"
"其实是苏联的虚张声势。\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/23
msgid ""
"Moscow'd gone to incredible lengths to perpetuate\n"
"the lie.\n"
msgstr ""
"莫斯科为了维持这个谎言\n"
"费尽心机。\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/24
msgid ""
"In fact, the whole space race was really just a part\n"
"of an elaborate ruse.\n"
msgstr ""
"事实上，整个太空竞赛\n"
"也是这场骗局的一环。\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/25
msgid ""
"Only we didn't know that at the time.\n"
msgstr ""
"只是当时我们并不知道。\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/26
msgid ""
"She used to joke that even she swallowed the\n"
"whole missile gap story hook, line, and sinker.\n"
msgstr ""
"她常开玩笑说，连自己都\n"
"对导弹差距的说法深信不疑。\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/27
msgid ""
"She put her life on the line for the sake of her\n"
"country - to prevent nuclear war.\n"
msgstr ""
"她为祖国赌上性命，\n"
"只为阻止核战争。\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/28
msgid ""
"And it was because of her sacrificial efforts that\n"
"America succeeded\n"
msgstr ""
"正是靠她牺牲般的努力，\n"
"美国才成功\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/29
msgid ""
"in placing a sleeper agent inside OKB-1.\n"
msgstr ""
"把一名潜伏特工安插进OKB-1。\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/30
msgid ""
"NASA began to receive huge volumes of technical\n"
"data from the Soviet program.\n"
msgstr ""
"NASA开始收到大量\n"
"来自苏联计划的技术资料。\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/31
msgid ""
"By the end of 1959,\n"
msgstr ""
"到1959年底，\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/32
msgid ""
"they'd succeeded in sending a chimpanzee named\n"
"Sam on a ballistic rocket flight.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们成功让一只叫山姆的黑猩猩\n"
"乘弹道火箭飞了一趟。\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/33
msgid ""
"The rocket never left the atmosphere,\n"
msgstr ""
"火箭没有飞出大气层，\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/34
msgid ""
"but all the same it was a huge success for NASA,\n"
msgstr ""
"但对NASA来说仍是巨大成功，\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/35
msgid ""
"restoring confidence in its technology.\n"
msgstr ""
"重新树立了对技术的信心。\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/36
msgid ""
"Then, just when the operation was starting to\n"
"produce results, the CIA came calling.\n"
msgstr ""
"就在行动初见成果时，\n"
"中情局找上门来。\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/37
msgid ""
"\"You're a war hero,\" they said.\n"
msgstr ""
"「你是战争英雄，」他们说。\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/38
msgid ""
"\"No need for you to dirty your hands with this sort\n"
"of black ops.\n"
msgstr ""
"「不必为这种黑色行动\n"
"弄脏你的手。\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/39
msgid ""
"We'll take it from here.\"\n"
msgstr ""
"接下来交给我们。」\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/40
msgid ""
"In effect, they wanted to reap the rewards for\n"
"themselves.\n"
msgstr ""
"说白了，\n"
"他们想独占果实。\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/41
msgid ""
"But The Boss didn't object. \"My part is over,\" she\n"
"said.\n"
msgstr ""
"但The Boss没有反对。\n"
"「我的戏份结束了，」她说。\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/42
msgid ""
"\"I don't care what you do with the data now.\"\n"
msgstr ""
"「那些资料你们怎么处理都行。」\n"

#: codec/1/279/0x117460/43
msgid ""
"It seemed as if NASA was making great strides\n"
"toward manned spaceflight\n"
msgstr ""
"NASA似乎正大步迈向\n"
"载人航天，\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/0
msgid ""
"The sleeper that she'd worked so hard to place\n"
"was a double agent.\n"
msgstr ""
"她费尽心思安插的卧底\n"
"是个双面间谍。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/1
msgid ""
"He'd been turned by the Soviets and was feeding\n"
"the Americans lies.\n"
msgstr ""
"他被苏联人策反，一直在给\n"
"美国人喂假情报。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/2
msgid ""
"But what shocked The Boss even more was why.\n"
msgstr ""
"但更让THE BOSS震惊的是原因。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/3
msgid ""
"The CIA's access agent had been taking a large\n"
"cut of the sleeper's pay.\n"
msgstr ""
"CIA特工一直从这潜伏者薪水里\n"
"抽走一大笔。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/4
msgid ""
"The sleeper felt what little he was left with wasn't\n"
"worth the risk.\n"
msgstr ""
"潜伏者觉得剩下的这点钱\n"
"不值得冒这个险。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/5
msgid ""
"When he got a better offer from Moscow, he took\n"
"it.\n"
msgstr ""
"莫斯科给更好条件，他就接了\n"
"。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/6
msgid ""
"At some point,\n"
msgstr ""
"不知何时\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/7
msgid ""
"the Americans' intelligence operation had become\n"
"an open book to the Soviets.\n"
msgstr ""
"美国人的情报行动对苏联人来说\n"
"已是一本摊开的书。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/8
msgid ""
"And contrary to what the sleeper'd been reporting,\n"
msgstr ""
"而与潜伏者一直汇报的相反，\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/9
msgid ""
"the Soviets' manned spaceflight technology was\n"
"quite advanced.\n"
msgstr ""
"苏联的载人航天技术\n"
"相当先进。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/10
msgid ""
"It wasn't until she infiltrated OKB-1 herself\n"
msgstr ""
"直到她亲自潜入OKB-1，\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/11
msgid ""
"that The Boss learned the truth about Sputnik 5.\n"
msgstr ""
"THE BOSS才得知人造卫星5号的真相。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/12
msgid ""
"After the spacecraft reentered the atmosphere, it\n"
"ejected the pilot\n"
msgstr ""
"飞船重返大气层后，在7000米高空\n"
"弹射出飞行员\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/13
msgid ""
"- seat and all - at an altitude of 7,000 meters.\n"
msgstr ""
"- 连同座椅一起。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/14
msgid ""
"It was the Soviets' solution to the problem of land\n"
"recovery.\n"
msgstr ""
"这是苏联人对土地\n"
"恢复问题的解决方案。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/15
msgid ""
"The mystery device attached to Sputnik 5 was for\n"
"that purpose.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sputnik 5上的神秘装置就为\n"
"此而设。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/16
msgid ""
"The pilot would parachute down from that high\n"
"altitude wearing a bulky spacesuit...\n"
msgstr ""
"飞行员将穿着笨重的宇航服从那样的高空\n"
"跳伞降落……\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/17
msgid ""
"Crazy, I know.\n"
msgstr ""
"我知道，很疯狂。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/18
msgid ""
"The Soviets knew exactly how dangerous it was, of\n"
"course.\n"
msgstr ""
"当然，苏联人非常清楚它有多危险\n"
"。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/19
msgid ""
"So much so that they gave Yuri Gagarin, the first\n"
"man in space,\n"
msgstr ""
"以至于他们给了尤里·加加林，首位\n"
"太空人，\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/20
msgid ""
"a special two-rank promotion before reentry.\n"
msgstr ""
"在重返前特批连升两级。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/21
msgid ""
"Only Moscow could come up with this kind of plan.\n"
msgstr ""
"只有莫斯科才想得出这种计划。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/22
msgid ""
"With total state control over information,\n"
msgstr ""
"凭借国家对信息的全面控制，\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/23
msgid ""
"they could easily pretend it never happened in the\n"
"event of a failure...\n"
msgstr ""
"一旦失败，他们可以轻易装作\n"
"从未发生……\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/24
msgid ""
"The Boss passed the info on to NASA. It was their\n"
"worst nightmare.\n"
msgstr ""
"THE BOSS把情报给了NASA。那是他们\n"
"最可怕的噩梦。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/25
msgid ""
"The glory of mankind's first spaceflight was about\n"
"to be stolen from them by the Soviet Union.\n"
msgstr ""
"人类首次太空飞行的荣耀即将\n"
"被苏联夺走。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/26
msgid ""
"It was Sputnik all over again...\n"
msgstr ""
"又是人造卫星重演……\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/27
msgid ""
"And the CIA was caught no less off guard.\n"
msgstr ""
"CIA也同样措手不及。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/28
msgid ""
"Their ineptitude had caused the fiasco in the first\n"
"place.\n"
msgstr ""
"正是他们的无能\n"
"才导致了这场惨败。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/29
msgid ""
"The Soviets' deception was brilliant. They'd woven\n"
"a masterful tapestry of truth and fiction\n"
msgstr ""
"苏联人的欺骗手段堪称绝妙。他们编织了\n"
"一幅真假交织的精妙画卷\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/30
msgid ""
"to convince the Americans their intelligence\n"
"operations were proceeding as planned.\n"
msgstr ""
"让美国人相信他们的情报\n"
"行动正按计划进行。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/31
msgid ""
"No one but The Boss could have seen through it...\n"
msgstr ""
"除了THE BOSS，没人能看穿……\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/32
msgid ""
"It was obvious the Soviets had some gifted minds\n"
"working on their side.\n"
msgstr ""
"显然苏联人有一些\n"
"天赋异禀的人才在为他们效力。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/33
msgid ""
"But that certainly didn't excuse the CIA's massive\n"
"failure.\n"
msgstr ""
"但这绝不能为中央情报局的重大\n"
"失误开脱。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/34
msgid ""
"The CIA wasn't done, though,\n"
msgstr ""
"但CIA没罢手，\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/35
msgid ""
"and devised an ingenious plan to avoid taking\n"
"responsibility.\n"
msgstr ""
"并设计了一个巧妙的计划来逃避\n"
"承担责任。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/36
msgid ""
"Luckily for them, a new President had been elected\n"
"the previous November - John F. Kennedy.\n"
msgstr ""
"对他们来说幸运的是，前一年十一月新当选了一位总统——约翰·F·肯尼迪。\n"
"\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/37
msgid ""
"As he didn't know the case history when taking\n"
"office,\n"
msgstr ""
"由于他上任时并不了解事件的来龙去脉，\n"
"\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/38
msgid ""
"the CIA was able to feed lies to his new\n"
"administration.\n"
msgstr ""
"中情局得以向他新组建的政府灌输谎言。\n"
"\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/39
msgid ""
"They masked their own failures, placing the blame\n"
"squarely on The Boss's shoulders.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们掩盖了自己的失败，把责任一股脑儿推到了“头儿”的肩上。\n"
"\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/40
msgid ""
"After all, she'd selected an unreliable sleeper.\n"
msgstr ""
"毕竟，她选了个靠不住的潜伏者。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/41
msgid ""
"They claimed she'd failed to make use of one of\n"
"the most effective means\n"
msgstr ""
"他们声称她没能利用起最有效的手段之一，\n"
"\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/42
msgid ""
"of controlling a sleeper agent's actions.\n"
msgstr ""
"即控制其行动的办法。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/43
msgid ""
"Holding their family hostage.\n"
msgstr ""
"扣押其家人当人质。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/44
msgid ""
"The Boss was well aware that would have worked -\n"
"she told me so later.\n"
msgstr ""
"“头儿”很清楚那样做本会奏效——她后来告诉了我。\n"
"\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/45
msgid ""
"But she couldn't bring herself to do it...\n"
msgstr ""
"但她下不了手……\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/46
msgid ""
"It seems clear it had to do with having her own\n"
"child taken.\n"
msgstr ""
"看来很明显，这与她自己的孩子被人夺走有关。\n"
"\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/47
msgid ""
"She could never inflict the same pain on anyone\n"
"else.\n"
msgstr ""
"她绝不会把同样的痛苦加诸于任何人身上。\n"
"\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/48
msgid ""
"The CIA used that against her.\n"
msgstr ""
"CIA利用这点对付她。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/49
msgid ""
"In his election campaign, Kennedy had vowed to\n"
"close the missile gap with Moscow.\n"
msgstr ""
"在竞选活动中，肯尼迪曾誓言要弥合与莫斯科之间的导弹差距。\n"
"\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/50
msgid ""
"If America lost the space race, that promise would\n"
"be worthless.\n"
msgstr ""
"如果美国输掉了太空竞赛，那个承诺就将一文不值。\n"
"\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/51
msgid ""
"The fact that the President had no links to the\n"
"Philosophers only made things worse.\n"
msgstr ""
"总统与“哲人”毫无关联，这反而让情况变得更糟。\n"
"\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/52
msgid ""
"He was completely unaware of the secret networks\n"
"she'd used to complete her mission.\n"
msgstr ""
"他完全不知道她曾利用哪些秘密网络来完成自己的任务。\n"
"\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/53
msgid ""
"In his eyes, she was no better than a traitor.\n"
msgstr ""
"在他眼里，她无异于叛徒。\n"

#: codec/1/281/0x119010/54
msgid ""
"The fate that awaited her was cruel beyond belief...\n"
msgstr ""
"等待她的命运残酷得难以想象……\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/0
msgid ""
"The order came down from above:\n"
msgstr ""
"命令来自上层：\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/1
msgid ""
"The Boss would take the official blame for the\n"
"sleeper's betrayal.\n"
msgstr ""
"The Boss要为潜伏者的背叛\n"
"承担公开罪责。\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/2
msgid ""
"More so, she'd serve as the guinea pig for NASA's\n"
"manned spaceflight program.\n"
msgstr ""
"更要紧的是，她要充当NASA\n"
"载人航天计划的试验品。\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/3
msgid ""
"By then, NASA had gotten as far as sending a\n"
"chimp named Ham into space.\n"
msgstr ""
"那时NASA已经做到\n"
"把一只叫汉姆的黑猩猩送上太空。\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/4
msgid ""
"Now came a whole battery of ground tests to pave\n"
"the way for a human to take its place.\n"
msgstr ""
"接下来是一整套地面试验，\n"
"为载人飞行铺路。\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/5
msgid ""
"High-G tests, zero-G tests, spacesuit tests,\n"
msgstr ""
"高G测试、零G测试、宇航服测试，\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/6
msgid ""
"simulations in pressurized oxygen environments...\n"
msgstr ""
"以及加压氧气环境的模拟……\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/7
msgid ""
"Some of the tests were highly dangerous. Too\n"
"dangerous for the Mercury Seven,\n"
msgstr ""
"有些测试极度危险，\n"
"对水星七杰来说过于危险，\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/8
msgid ""
"who were by then already media darlings.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们那时已是媒体宠儿。\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/9
msgid ""
"So The Boss was made to stand in for them.\n"
msgstr ""
"于是The Boss被安排顶替他们。\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/10
msgid ""
"She could have refused the order\n"
msgstr ""
"她本可以拒绝这道命令\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/11
msgid ""
"- argued her side of the story against the CIA. But\n"
"she didn't.\n"
msgstr ""
"——与中情局据理力争。\n"
"可她没有。\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/12
msgid ""
"The way she saw it,\n"
msgstr ""
"在她看来，\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/13
msgid ""
"her military experience made her a potentially\n"
"valuable asset to those tests.\n"
msgstr ""
"她的从军经历使她\n"
"对这些测试很有价值。\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/14
msgid ""
"She felt it was her duty to accept.\n"
msgstr ""
"她觉得接受是自己的职责。\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/15
msgid ""
"She soon proved herself right.\n"
msgstr ""
"很快她就证明了自己。\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/16
msgid ""
"The Boss was more than just a guinea pig.\n"
msgstr ""
"The Boss不只是试验品。\n"

#: codec/1/282/0x11a440/17
msgid ""
"She drew on her experience to give the staff\n"
"focused advice exactly where it was needed.\n"
msgstr ""
"她凭经验在最关键的地方\n"
"给出中肯的建议。\n"
